 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg6-00",
   "text": "普通用户，可以从这几件事做起。",
   "spoken": "普通用户，可以从这几件事做起。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg6-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.288,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.055
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "交易所和邮箱，用硬件密钥或验证器 App，关掉短信验证。",
   "spoken": "交易所和邮箱，用硬件密钥或验证器 App，关掉短信验证。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg6-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.108,
   "dur": 5.568,
   "speechStart": 5.206,
   "speechEnd": 9.825
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "向运营商申请号码转移锁。",
   "spoken": "向运营商申请号码转移锁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg6-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.896,
   "dur": 2.976,
   "speechStart": 10.994,
   "speechEnd": 13.041
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "关注的项目方账号，突然发限时空投、紧急迁移，先去别的官方渠道核实。",
   "spoken": "关注的项目方账号，突然发限时空投、紧急迁移，先去别的官方渠道核实。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg6-03.mp3",
   "start": 14.092,
   "dur": 6.744,
   "speechStart": 14.19,
   "speechEnd": 19.999
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "和陌生网友线下见面，选公共场所，让别人知道你的行程。",
   "spoken": "和陌生网友线下见面，选公共场所，让别人知道你的行程。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg6-04.mp3",
   "start": 21.056,
   "dur": 5.352,
   "speechStart": 21.154,
   "speechEnd": 25.582
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "遭遇胁迫时，人身安全第一，事后立即报警。",
   "spoken": "遭遇胁迫时，人身安全第一，事后立即报警。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg6-05.mp3",
   "start": 26.628,
   "dur": 4.752,
   "speechStart": 26.726,
   "speechEnd": 30.547
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "如果你是多签签名人，今天就查一遍，你的手机号能不能单独重置哪个账号。",
   "spoken": "如果你是多签签名人，今天就查一遍，你的手机号能不能单独虫置哪个账号。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg6-06.mp3",
   "start": 31.6,
   "dur": 7.08,
   "speechStart": 31.698,
   "speechEnd": 37.829
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "如果你管理官方账号，今天就把它的多因素认证，换成硬件密钥。",
   "spoken": "如果你管理官方账号，今天就把它的多因素认证，换成硬件密钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg6-07.mp3",
   "start": 38.9,
   "dur": 5.616,
   "speechStart": 38.998,
   "speechEnd": 43.676
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "如果你负责团队，列一份关键人员名单，给每个人配上号码锁和硬件密钥。",
   "spoken": "如果你负责团队，列一份关键人员名单，给每个人配上号码锁和硬件密钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg6-08.mp3",
   "start": 44.736,
   "dur": 6.624,
   "speechStart": 44.834,
   "speechEnd": 50.512
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-09",
   "text": "回到开头的题。",
   "spoken": "回到开头的题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg6-09.mp3",
   "start": 51.58,
   "dur": 2.16,
   "speechStart": 51.678,
   "speechEnd": 52.904
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-10",
   "text": "答案是没有，SEC 承认，此前曾请 X 关闭这个账号的多因素认证。",
   "spoken": "答案是没有，SEC 承认，此前曾请 X 关闭这个账号的多因素认证。",
