   "start": 53.96,
   "dur": 6.264,
   "speechStart": 54.058,
   "speechEnd": 59.379
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-11",
   "text": "攻击者对绑定的手机号做了 SIM 卡劫持，再用重置码登录。",
   "spoken": "攻击者对绑定的手机号做了 SIM 卡劫持，再用虫置码登录。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg6-11.mp3",
   "start": 60.444,
   "dur": 5.568,
   "speechStart": 60.542,
   "speechEnd": 65.173
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-12",
   "text": "负责换卡的人，2025 年被判 14 个月。",
   "spoken": "负责换卡的人，2025 年被判 14 个月。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg6-12.mp3",
   "start": 66.232,
   "dur": 4.392,
   "speechStart": 66.33,
   "speechEnd": 69.794
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-13",
   "text": "监管机构的账号也会失守，只要一条短信，就能单独完成恢复。",
   "spoken": "监管机构的账号也会失守，只要一条短信，就能单独完成恢复。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg6-13.mp3",
   "start": 70.844,
   "dur": 5.592,
   "speechStart": 70.942,
   "speechEnd": 75.584
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-14",
   "text": "攻击从链上走到线下，防线就要让一张卡、一次胁迫，都不够拿走一切。",
   "spoken": "攻击从链上走到线下，防线就要让一张卡、一次胁迫，都不够拿走一切。",
